               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_e260d6d8">1 bifolio. Written in ink. Paper: 20 staves. Heading on fol.1<rend xml:id="idm36" rend="sup">r</rend>: "Smaae Krigsbilleder. (Febr. 1864)". In upper right-hand corner: "Tirsdag". No. 1 on fol.1.<rend xml:id="idm37" rend="sup">r</rend>; No. 2 on fol.1.<rend xml:id="idm38" rend="sup">v</rend> staves 1-8, in upper right-hand corner "Onsdag"; No. 3 on fol.1.<rend xml:id="idm39" rend="sup">v</rend> staves 9-20, heading: "Feltliv"; No. 4 on fol.2.<rend xml:id="idm40" rend="sup">r.</rend>, heading: "Forpost paa Kjæmpehöien"; On fol.2.<rend xml:id="idm41" rend="sup">v</rend> upside-down a sketch for a movement in D minor 6/8. Tempo marking "Vivace". In upper right-hand corner: "Pag 107."</physMedium>
